            "review_title": "Review at Mangkorn Thai Cuisine & Bar",
            "review_text": "Tello H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGenuine Thais taste with a feel-like-home serving\nAug 2022\nMe and my colleagues's favourite place for a business lunch. For a group of 4, we order 4-5 dishes with drinks and desserts, and we were more than ready to work in the afternoon. Delicious food, super friendly and supporting staff.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 3, 2022",
