            "review_title": "Review at Mangkorn Thai Cuisine & Bar",
            "review_text": "Yan Cui Travel\n253 contributions\n1\nExquisite Thai chef made\nMay 2022 • Friends\nMy friends and I have visited many Thai restaurant in the town but we all confirm that Mangkorn is one of the best in terms of the dining ambience and food tastes and varieties. While others bring diners some popular Thai cuisines such as tom yum, pad thai, som tam (papaya salad), coconut curry with chicken/ seafood/ fish, this eatery offers many more Thai specialities which are made by the Thai chef. We did order one exceptional set of dishes for 4 persons including jelly fish salad, Yentafo hotpot, deep fried crab rolls… and we enjoyed eating these amazing fare.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 4, 2022",
